## IMPORTANT INFORMATION ABOUT OUR INVESTMENT, PENSION AND PROTECTION ADVICE SERVICES
TFAS
## WHO ARE WE AND WHAT DO WE DO?
TFAS Wealth Limited believe that when people want access to expert and impartial advice on their options for investment, they want it to be a friendly and efficient service. We take enormous pride in being able to welcome our clients to our easy and straightforward service delivering what they want and need.
